{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/desc1R.png?t=1745937594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a detective working for the police. Your current mission: locate a massive, abandoned facility hidden deep within a Russian forest. According to scattered reports, the place was used for highly suspicious activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are equipped with a <strong>photo camera</strong> and a high-tech objective-finding device known as <strong>S.E.R.A</strong> (<strong>Spectral Emission Recognition Apparatus)</strong> \u2014 capable of detecting nearby objects with fingerprints or fresh blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task: <strong>find and photograph every clue</strong> that could help the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/desc2R.png?t=1745937594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To reach the depths, you'll descend countless floors sometimes by<strong> rusted elevator</strong>, sometimes by <strong>stairs</strong>. The facility is vast, spanning numerous levels. Each level is different and hides its own challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t know what awaits in the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you will \u2014 soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/desc3R.png?t=1745937594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your descent, you\u2019ll need to solve <strong>puzzles</strong>, uncover new <strong>tools</strong> and gather <strong>equipment</strong> to go deeper. There are <strong>collectibles</strong>, <strong>mini-games</strong>, and secrets scattered along the way. Every level may bring you closer to the truth \u2014 or further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you reach the bottom you\u2019ll know everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <strong>must</strong> do this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is <strong>no other way</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3481510?t=1745937594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/3b67335073b086f24958ad11c8f2aefe5a6434ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745937594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/20b01ddf86428e7d08d3a0b3515c4329390217ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745937594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/20b01ddf86428e7d08d3a0b3515c4329390217ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745937594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/desc1R.png?t=1745937594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a detective working for the police. Your current mission: locate a massive, abandoned facility hidden deep within a Russian forest. According to scattered reports, the place was used for highly suspicious activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are equipped with a <strong>photo camera</strong> and a high-tech objective-finding device known as <strong>S.E.R.A</strong> (<strong>Spectral Emission Recognition Apparatus)</strong> \u2014 capable of detecting nearby objects with fingerprints or fresh blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task: <strong>find and photograph every clue</strong> that could help the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/desc2R.png?t=1745937594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To reach the depths, you'll descend countless floors sometimes by<strong> rusted elevator</strong>, sometimes by <strong>stairs</strong>. The facility is vast, spanning numerous levels. Each level is different and hides its own challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t know what awaits in the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you will \u2014 soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/extras/desc3R.png?t=1745937594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your descent, you\u2019ll need to solve <strong>puzzles</strong>, uncover new <strong>tools</strong> and gather <strong>equipment</strong> to go deeper. There are <strong>collectibles</strong>, <strong>mini-games</strong>, and secrets scattered along the way. Every level may bring you closer to the truth \u2014 or further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you reach the bottom you\u2019ll know everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <strong>must</strong> do this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is <strong>no other way</strong>.</p>","developers":["Lazaganye"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481510/77b95d2c3a4e209b3a740cdfd5bfb86874ce4047/header.jpg?t=1745937594","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Lazaganye. All Rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128347,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128347/movie480.mp4?t=1745937591","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128347/movie_max.mp4?t=1745937591"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128347/1cc2a00b3c207799cae56069117ab17e2c0c17e4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745937591","webm":{"480":"http